    "description": {
      "content": "The Inkit REST API enables developers to generate PDF documents from HTML templates, manage document storage and retrieval, launch document workflows and batches, and manage digital signature requests. Authentication uses the X-Inkit-API-Token header. The API enforces a rate limit of 300 requests per minute.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Inkit Support",
